        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In May 2026, we introduced an AI-driven assistant within the FedEx Developer Portal to help developers more efficiently access documentation, receive real-time technical guidance, and accelerate integrations with FedEx digital services.",
        "start_character": 41991,
        "end_character": 42227
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001048911-26-000105",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001048911-26-000105-514bdc2a5cd4f38e",
        "accession_number": "0001048911-26-000105",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-20",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we offer comprehensive international express and deferred freight services, real-time tracking, and advanced customs clearance.",
        "start_character": 19038,
        "end_character": 19178
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001048911-26-000105",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001048911-26-000105-514bdc2a5cd4f38e",
        "accession_number": "0001048911-26-000105",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-20",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our business strategy also provides flexibility in structuring our network to align with varying macroeconomic conditions and customer demand for the market segments in which the customer operates, allowing us to leverage and manage change.",
        "start_character": 5779,
        "end_character": 6019
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001048911-26-000105",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001048911-26-000105-514bdc2a5cd4f38e",
        "accession_number": "0001048911-26-000105",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-20",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Protecting the health and safety of our team members, service providers, and the communities we serve is fundamental to how we operate.",
        "start_character": 69707,
        "end_character": 69842
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001048911-26-000105",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001048911-26-000105-514bdc2a5cd4f38e",
        "accession_number": "0001048911-26-000105",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Under Network 2.0, we utilize both employee couriers and service providers in surface operations using a market-by-market approach.",
        "start_character": 14751,
        "end_character": 14882
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001048911-26-000105",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001048911-26-000105-514bdc2a5cd4f38e",
        "accession_number": "0001048911-26-000105",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-20",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer an economy service that is available for the consolidation and delivery of high volumes of low-weight, less time-sensitive business-to-consumer packages to any residential address in the U.S.",
        "start_character": 13462,
        "end_character": 13667
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001048911-26-000105",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001048911-26-000105-514bdc2a5cd4f38e",
        "accession_number": "0001048911-26-000105",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-20",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer domestic pickup-and-delivery services within certain non-U.S.",
        "start_character": 18809,
        "end_character": 18884
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001048911-26-000105",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001048911-26-000105-514bdc2a5cd4f38e",
        "accession_number": "0001048911-26-000105",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-20",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer express overnight and deferred freight services to handle the needs of the time-definite freight market.",
        "start_character": 12931,
        "end_character": 13049
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001048911-26-000105",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001048911-26-000105-514bdc2a5cd4f38e",
        "accession_number": "0001048911-26-000105",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-20",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide customs clearance services at our major U.S.",
        "start_character": 19582,
        "end_character": 19642
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001048911-26-000105",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001048911-26-000105-514bdc2a5cd4f38e",
        "accession_number": "0001048911-26-000105",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-20",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We offer three overnight package delivery services (FedEx First Overnight, FedEx Priority Overnight, and FedEx Standard Overnight) and three deferred package delivery services (FedEx 2Day, FedEx 2Day AM, and FedEx Express Saver).",
        "start_character": 12586,
        "end_character": 12815
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001048911-26-000105",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001048911-26-000105-514bdc2a5cd4f38e",
        "accession_number": "0001048911-26-000105",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-20",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate more than 4,000 facilities across the globe, including air and ground hubs, local stations, freight service centers, and retail locations.",
        "start_character": 86825,
        "end_character": 86974
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001048911-26-000105",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001048911-26-000105-514bdc2a5cd4f38e",
        "accession_number": "0001048911-26-000105",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We continue to collaborate with leading vehicle manufacturers to co-develop EVs that are better suited to the demands of our Network 2.0 optimization strategy, which aims to improve delivery efficiency by redesigning routes and aligning vehicle capacity with shipment volume.",
